  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that config_009 (multimodal, multiprofile, scvi_n200, imagenet_vit_l, avgpool, weighted) achieved 0.706 validation accuracy. This experiment tests replacing the image encoder with resnet50 (a simpler, cheaper model) while keeping other components the same. It clarifies whether the choice of image encoder significantly impacts accuracy. Resnet50 is expected to have lower training cost (~3.5-4 GPU hours) than ViT, allowing more experiments within the budget while exploring a key design choice."
